Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,《Current Affairs》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Knew when I felt it hit\N♪ 当我感受到它来袭时就已明白 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stood in the park under the eclipse\N♪ 站在日蚀下的公园里 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.09,0:00:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only a field trip\N♪ 那不过是场实地考察 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.86,0:00:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Till it cooled my blood\N♪ 直到它冷却我的血液 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it tends to start\N♪ 事情总是这样开始 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.34,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the light, then you're in the dark\N♪ 你身处光明 转瞬堕入黑暗 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then someone throws a flare\N♪ 接着有人投出信号弹 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.77,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You tasted my underwear\N♪ 你尝过我的内衣 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we were fucked\N♪ 我知道我们完蛋了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My bed is on fire\N♪ 我的床正在燃烧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.12,0:01:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm so scared\N♪ 妈妈，我好害怕 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know how to come back\N♪ 不知该如何回头 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.61,0:01:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get out on the edge\N♪ 当我跨出边缘一步 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He spit in my mouth like\N♪ 他将唾液吐进我口中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.69,0:01:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saying a prayer\N♪ 仿佛在念诵祷文 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm crying on the phone\N♪ 但此刻我对着电话哭泣 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Swearing nothing's wrong\N♪ 发誓说一切安好 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame it on\N♪ 全都归咎于 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Current affairs\N♪ 时事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Current affairs\N♪ 时事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.89,0:01:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All alone in my room\N♪ 独自蜷缩房间 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching the tape of their honeymoon\N♪ 看着他们的蜜月录像 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,On the boat, it was pure and true\N♪ 船上时光纯净而真实 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the film came out\N♪ 直到影片曝光 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.59,0:02:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope that we can ignore\N♪ 但愿我们能无视 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Voices we hear through the open door\N♪ 从门缝传来的私语 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you dive to the ocean floor\N♪ 你可愿潜至海底 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to take my pearl?\N♪ 只为拾取我的珍珠？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause my bed is on fire\N♪ 因我的床正在燃烧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm so scared\N♪ 妈妈，我好害怕 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you ever like this?\N♪ 你可曾如此过？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you went out on the edge?\N♪ 当你踏足悬崖边缘？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He spit in my mouth like\N♪ 他将唾液吐进我口中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's saying a prayer\N♪ 仿佛在念诵祷文 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm crying on the phone\N♪ 但此刻我对着电话哭泣 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Swearing nothing's wrong\N♪ 发誓说一切安好 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame it on\N♪ 全都归咎于 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Current affairs\N♪ 时事 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm high enough to know\N♪ 此刻我足够清醒地明白 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think he's gon' blame it on\N♪ 是的 他终将归咎于 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh-uh-uh-uh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.61,0:03:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Current affairs\N♪ 时事 ♪
